Description: MediaTek data path: +CGACT, ccmni net port, static IP from +CGCONTRDP
 MediaTek modems have no PPP on the AT port (ATD*99# is taken as a voice
 call). With ID_MM_BF7_MTK_DATA=1 on the net port the generic bearer
 activates the context with +CGACT, returns the net port and reads the
 IPv4 settings with +CGCONTRDP. Other modems are unaffected.
Author: bf7
Forwarded: not-needed

